	(text "+5V_S5: TPS259474L circuit breaker U5 (2.01 / 2.27 / 2.46 A), 20 mR shunt, INA226 0x4D (U_PM4D)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 247.65 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "87f54a74-5388-5d4a-b258-9968e507bd4b")
	)
	(text "R_ILM 1.47k: I_LIM = 3334 / R_ILM (SLVSFC9C Eq. 5). C_ITIMER 2.2n: 1.85 ms blanking (Eq. 6), then it\nlatches off until EN_5V_S5 goes low. C_dVdt 2.2n: about 0.9 V/ms. OVLO = GND (enabled; VSYS is\nbehind U2). PGTH 100k / 39k: PG above 4.28 V -> S5_PG. Full scale 4.10 A, LSB 125 uA (SPEC §3.4).\nKelvin pads TP908 / TP909 (SPEC's TP_IS5+ / TP_IS5-) across the shunt for a scope (SPEC §3.6).\nKelvin (D4): IN+ / IN- through net ties NT4DP / NT4DN at R913's pads (SPEC §7.5)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 247.65 19.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ee1eb1f8-738b-5c67-8fc8-ea4c8d6aff51")
	)
